A-2-Z Ply City Center — Phase 1 MVP

Decisions locked

Scope: Phase 1 MVP (storefront + admin). Wishlist/cart/payments/reviews are deferred; product schema only reserves room where cheap (e.g. viewCount).

Stack: Next.js 15 (App Router) + TypeScript + Tailwind + Framer Motion + Swiper | FastAPI + MongoDB (Motor) | Cloudinary | JWT admin auth.

Images: Cloudinary via signed uploads from admin; store public URLs + public_id on documents.

Monorepo layout:

[frontend/](frontend/) — Next.js customer site + admin UI
[backend/](backend/) — FastAPI API

Root README.md with env and run instructions

